<title>INDONESIA: Indonesian Parliament Sept 30 - Oct 4.</title>
<headline>Indonesian Parliament Sept 30 - Oct 4.</headline>
<dateline>JAKARTA 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is a list of business before parliamentary committees this week:</p>
<p>MONDAY, SEPT 30</p>
<p>- Plenary meeting to discuss draft bill on psychotropic</p>
<p>subtances</p>
<p>- Internal meeting to set up a special committee to discuss</p>
<p>draft bill on nuclear power</p>
<p>- Internal meeting to set up a special committee to discuss</p>
<p>draft bill on disabled people</p>
<p>WEDNESDAY, OCT 2</p>
<p>- Plenary meeting to discuss reports over proposed 1997/1998</p>
<p>state budget from Committee I up to Committee V.</p>
<p>THURSDAY, OCT 3</p>
<p>- Plenary meeting to discuss reports over proposed 1997/1998</p>
<p>state budget.</p>
<p>FRIDAY SEPT OCT 4</p>
<p>- Internal meetings</p>
</text>
